vars: {
  d2-config: {
    sketch: true
  }
}

direction: down

User: {shape: person}

Client: Client Layer {
  ui: Discord-like Chat UI
}

Mesh: Agent Mesh Layer {
  a1: Agent A
  a2: Agent B
  a3: Agent C

  a1 <-> a2: sessions (1..n)
  a2 <-> a3: sessions (1..n)
  a1 <-> a3: sessions (1..n)
}

Memory: Project Memory Layer {
  am: Agent Memory\nrole / rules / Poincare hierarchy
  kg: Knowledge Graph\ndocs & papers as nodes
}

Config: Custom Config

User <-> Client.ui: chat
Client.ui <-> Mesh: messages\n(every agent)
Mesh <-> Memory.am: read / write\n(every agent)
Mesh <-> Memory.kg: read / write\n(every agent)
Memory.am <-> Memory.kg
Config -> Mesh: define swarm
